   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Vietnamese. It's in the\nbuild. It's not on the\npage.",
   "start": 4.632,
   "duration": 3.468,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It's Seaside Wash. You\nscrape barnacles and rust\noff wrecked ships.",
   "start": 10.35,
   "duration": 4.539,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Six hundred and nine\nmegabytes. A hundred and\nninety-one files.",
   "start": 15.139,
   "duration": 4.434,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It's Unity on Mono, so the\nlocalization tables sit\nthere with their names on\nthem.",
